                <pb facs="1105" n="1009" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1009"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr. Woodford.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-11"><hi rendition="#italic">February 11,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your last telegram as to De Lôme incident says, “Full report to follow.”
                    Telegraph that report, giving details.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Day</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
